WEBVTT

00:05:59.621 --> 00:06:02.496
or whatever your nagging uncle
keeps telling you to do,

00:06:02.913 --> 00:06:04.663
you're probably doing that already.

00:06:05.413 --> 00:06:07.371
It means doing what you can to change

00:06:07.371 --> 00:06:11.538
the circumstance rather than grinding
against it, identifying the ways,

00:06:11.538 --> 00:06:15.996
large or small, that you can exert some
control in an out of control situation.

00:06:16.788 --> 00:06:18.788
It turned out that Aaron loved teaching.

00:06:19.329 --> 00:06:22.413
A few years later, he ended up pivoting
it into his current career,

00:06:22.663 --> 00:06:25.329
where he's helping others learn
from his earlier setback.

00:06:25.996 --> 00:06:30.496
I work at a nearby prison, Hamilton
Correctional Institution.